<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Helen, your safety check found something to fix first</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Your fixes quote is $680.00. Please approve it soon so you stay inside the 30 days.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading">Helen, your safety check found something to fix first</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Spark Electrical checked your home on Thursday 5 November. A couple of things need fixing before insulation can go in safely. This is common in older homes, and it's why the check exists.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 10px">What they found</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 6px">
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="plus">!</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">4 old downlights that can't be covered by insulation</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="plus">!</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">One ceiling cable joint that isn't enclosed</td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 10px">Your fixes quote</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 12px">
            <tr><td valign="top" style="padding:0 12px 12px 0;"><strong>Replace 4 downlights with IC-rated LEDs</strong><br /><span class="muted" style="font-size:13px;line-height:19px;">4 × $120.00, supplied and installed</span></td><td align="right" valign="top" style="padding:0 0 12px;white-space:nowrap;">$480.00</td></tr>
            <tr><td valign="top" style="border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;padding:12px 12px 12px 0;"><strong>Enclose cable joint in a junction box</strong><br /><span class="muted" style="font-size:13px;line-height:19px;">Labour and parts</span></td><td align="right" valign="top" style="border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;padding:12px 0;white-space:nowrap;">$200.00</td></tr>
            <tr><td valign="middle" style="border-top:2px solid #22376B;padding:12px 12px 6px 0;font-size:18px;"><strong>Total incl. GST</strong></td><td align="right" valign="middle" style="border-top:2px solid #22376B;padding:12px 0 6px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:18px;color:#3C51C4;"><strong>$680.00</strong></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-amber">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" color="#8A5200" padding="18px 18px 6px">&#9200; The 30-day clock</mj-text>
          <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="23px" padding="0 18px 18px"><strong>Please approve this quickly.</strong> Your safety check expires 30 days after it was done (on <strong>5 December</strong>), and the fixes and the install both need to happen before then. If it expires, a new safety check is needed and may be charged.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text padding="18px 12px 14px">Our office checked this quote before it reached you. You pay in full when you approve. Once the fixes are done, you'll get your Certificate of Electrical Safety and can book your install day.</mj-text>
          <mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST?screen=fixes">Approve and pay $680.00</mj-button>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="0 12px 0">Questions about the fixes? Just reply to this email. Nothing is done without your OK.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-trade.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
